quexit
======

quexit handles specific keys like
'exit'.

Set a key
=========

A key can be set by running
quexit -config 'key'

Who even needs this?
====================
Me, I often write q instead of exit
which annoys me so I'm fixing my
clumpsy-self with quexit. And it will
also give Linux users who need to customise
every pixel another way of customisation.
